jx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>:</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">}</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</div></div>",
